/-
Formalization of Local Disagreement Spectrum Evolution.

We define the mutation context, killed mutants, and survivors.
We define the disagreement probability `disagreementProb` and the local disagreement spectrum `localDisagreementSpectrum`.
We prove that the size of the spectrum is antitone (non-increasing) with respect to the test suite (`spectrum_size_antitone`).
We prove that the maximum disagreement probability in the spectrum is antitone (`spectrum_max_antitone`).
We prove that the minimum disagreement probability in the spectrum is monotone (non-decreasing) (`spectrum_min_monotone`).
We define the mean of the spectrum `spectrumMean`.
